	(text "Rating 12-40 V, 6 A, 200 uF load (bench 12 V)\nSCP trip 6.78-14.31 A (ESTIMATE), min +13.0 % over 6 A\ntSC 70.7-132.9 us, latch-off\nUVLO on 8.24-10.53 V, off 7.65-9.74 V (min bus 10.8 V)\nOV trip 13.20-16.49 V, reset 12.16-15.35 V\nInrush 1.43-2.74 A into 200 uF\nTurn-on delay 4.7-64.3 ms\nWorst Q1 Tj 116.7 C (100 A fault, ESTIMATE)\nFAIL (open items): no TVS turn-off >= 100 V vs 100 V abs max; gate-good overlap 0.24 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
